{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1402914-that-growl-thing-in-bloodlines-2-is-annoying","id":1402914,"title":"That growl thing in Bloodlines 2 is annoying","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-14T22:25:45-07:00","id":1402914,"title":"That growl thing in Bloodlines 2 is annoying","content":"That growl thing your character does when feeding is annoying rather than cool. Hopefully they drop it before the game goes live.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-15T06:56:34-07:00","id":1402940,"title":"","content":"First off, is this really worth a thread? Second, you may want to consider making this comment over in the <a href=\"https://forum.paradoxplaza.com/forum/forums/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2.1039/\" target=\"_blank\">Paradox Interactive</a> forums as that's were the producers and devs regularly interact with people. Saying that here is fairly meaningless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-16T23:30:59-07:00","id":1403187,"title":"","content":"First off, I feel it is impolite to ask someone if their opinion is really worth sharing.<br /> <br /> 1. You need a paradox account to post there. 2. The forum is pretty dead at the moment 3. The chance of devs actually changing anything is pretty slim.<br /> <br /> That said I agree with the growling voice being annoying.<br /> <br /> I am a bit worried about the combat system, but I was also the only person that enjoyed the combat in BL1. Lets see how it feels when we get our hands on it.<br /> <br /> I do not like how the first Thaumaturgy power looks like. Throwing a blob at someone's feet looks so - silly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26030,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26030-mfalkenb","user":"mfalkenb","date":". 07-17-2020, 03:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26030-mfalkenb","name":"mfalkenb","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T10:28:21-07:00","id":1403248,"title":"","content":"if it's just the growl thing, some modder is probably gonna fix it at some point<br /> but is it &quot;just&quot; the growl thing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T10:41:16-07:00","id":1403250,"title":"","content":"It beats your neighbors thinking you're watching porn, like the feed sounds from the first one <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Yes this happened to me while I was playing the Bloodlines.<br /> <br /> The reason they gave for the delay of the game was specifically to improve the combat. So it should hopefully be a lot better than what the early teasers have shown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14519-drhappyangry","name":"DrHappyAngry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14519_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T15:48:01-07:00","id":1403297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrHappyAngry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1402914-that-growl-thing-in-bloodlines-2-is-annoying?p=1403250#post1403250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It beats your neighbors thinking you're watching porn, like the feed sounds from the first one <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Yes this happened to me while I was playing the Bloodlines.<br /> <br /> The reason they gave for the delay of the game was specifically to improve the combat. So it should hopefully be a lot better than what the early teasers have shown.</div> </div> </div> </div>Didn't VTMB1 just have a heart beat during feeding? Now they did moan in VTMR and feeding was much slower.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T16:39:34-07:00","id":1403300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mfalkenb</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1402914-that-growl-thing-in-bloodlines-2-is-annoying?p=1403187#post1403187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off, I feel it is impolite to ask someone if their opinion is really worth sharing.<br /> <br /> 1. You need a paradox account to post there. 2. The forum is pretty dead at the moment 3. The chance of devs actually changing anything is pretty slim.<br /> <br /> That said I agree with the growling voice being annoying.<br /> <br /> I am a bit worried about the combat system, but I was also the only person that enjoyed the combat in BL1. Lets see how it feels when we get our hands on it.<br /> <br /> I do not like how the first Thaumaturgy power looks like. Throwing a blob at someone's feet looks so - silly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, the original comment is rather lacking in substance. It's literally a single complaint about a minor thing in video game being developed by another company. Doubly so when there is a large <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1298479-bloodlines-2-announced\">Bloodlines 2 thread</a> already in this very forum. Now if this was the OP's comment had more substance to it, I'd cut them slack (though I'd probably still say they should have posted in the aforementioned BL2 thread) and let it slide.<br /> <br /> As for the Paradox forum requiring an account, yes forums require accounts. Paradox doesn't charge you anything to make an account so why should it matter? Especially if the OP wants the devs to hear it. Is it pretty dead at the moment, yeah but than that's because there's been little news lately (though there was a recent comment from a dev that they were looking to release another dev diary before the end of the month) so no one has anything new to talk about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T18:12:35-07:00","id":1403316,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar420_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"420\" data-vbnamecard=\"420\">AkatsukiLeader13</a> <br /> <br /> Just spitballing here, but... maybe... instead of complaining about your minor annoyance that others are making complaints about minor annoyances in pop-culture franchises, you could look at <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3598_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3598\" data-vbnamecard=\"3598\">CajunKhan</a>'s post as a sign that this is a forum where posing such &quot;minor&quot; concerns is allowed and encouraged?<br /> <br /> Surely, there is some little detail of pop culture you would like to chat about. This is a safe place to do that. Jump right in!<br /> <br /> Besides, let's face it, this is the internet. It exists to complain about the minor annoyances in life.<br /> <br /> (My pop-culture annoyance is grammatically incorrect movie titles. For god's sake, they spent $18M making &quot;Honey, I Shrunk The Kids&quot;. It would have taken only one English major to conjugate their verbs properly.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11558-nosimplehiway","name":"Nosimplehiway","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11558_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T20:56:23-07:00","id":1403331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spencer from The Hills</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1402914-that-growl-thing-in-bloodlines-2-is-annoying?p=1403297#post1403297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Didn't VTMB1 just have a heart beat during feeding? Now they did moan in VTMR and feeding was much slower.</div> </div> </div> </div>It did have the hearbeat, but there were moans, squeals when you grabbed female NPCs and other sounds that did not sound great when heard without context.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14519-drhappyangry","name":"DrHappyAngry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14519_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}